rooms_desc ({"Welcome...this is Nae's *NEW* house. She's been busy redecorating,and can't wait to show you around! So take off your coat, kick off yourshoes, and get ready...there may be some surprises waiting for you.","This room is giant! Obviously, Nae must love her baths. As you look around, you see all the things that she enjoys in here:  the bubblebath, thesoaps, the bath oils, and an assortment of bath tools. One wall is devotedto holding a giant mirror, with shelves on either sides. A towel rack holdsher towels, and to the east is the largest tub you've ever seen!","You step through the doorway, and are transported into a winter hideaway...Although you see snow through the windows, this room is snug and warm,thanks to the fireplace across from you. This room seems so safe, withheavy wooden doors, bookshelves all along one wall, and a couple ofleather chairs in a corner, waiting for you to sit in them. In front of the fireplace, a giant fluffy rug lies inviting you to lie downand enjoy the ambience of the fire.","You slide slowly into the tub, letting the water inch it's way up your body.As you look around, you scoop up some bubbles and blow them playfully aroundthe room. You decide a long bath is just what you needed.","As you enter this room, the faint hint of Nae's perfume lets you know thisis an entirely feminine room. The high, four-poster bed has a victorianlace comforter, and several pillows dressing it up. Against one wall isNae's dressing table, with her cosmetics and perfumes scattered on top.There is a small bookshelf near her bed, for those nights when she can'tsleep. You think you see another small room to the south, but it's justher walk-in closet.","This is a brand new, unfurnished room.  As soon as you see it, youstart imagining interesting ways to decorate it.. it could be anything,a cupboard, a conservatory, an orchard, heaven or hell..A small note in the corner says:  'help build/furnish'.","It's just another empty room, just like all the rooms in Nae's house.","You step through the doorway, and are transported to a moonlit forest...The moonlight dapples the ground below you, and though the ground is dry theair has the fresh scent of rain. The trees are spaced far enough apartto allow freedom of movement, while still ensuring privacy...","This is a brand new, unfurnished room.  As soon as you see it, youstart imagining interesting ways to decorate it.. it could be anything,a cupboard, a conservatory, an orchard, heaven or hell..A small note in the corner says:  'help build/furnish'.","Wow...this room is cluttered! There is a bar to your left with clotheshanging from it, and a row of shelves. To your right is a stack ofboxes. You wonder what's in them...",})
rooms_short ({"Entrance hall","The bathroom","The Study.","A bathtub","Nae's Bedroom.","A brand new room, ready to be decorated","An Empty Room","Forest.","A brand new room, ready to be decorated","Walk-in Closet.",})
