items ({({"bed","This bed has satin sheets and lots of pillows. Ooohhh...you want to get in!","pillows","These pillows are soft and perfect for curling up with.","rug","This rug cushions the floor in front of the fireplace.","fireplace","There is a roaring fire...","","",}),({"room","A large, luxurious bathroom.","things","Lots of things to make a bath more than a way to get clean.","bubblebath","It's bubblebath, for making frothy scented bubbles in the tub.","soaps","Decorative soaps arranged in a dish.","Dish","Just a dish full of soaps.","oils","Lots of scented bath oils to make Nae's skin smooth and silky.","dish","Just a dish full of soap.","tools","A loofah, a bath brush, and assorted things to get Nae clean.","mirror","Wow, what a good-looking person...wait, it's you!","shelves","Shelves loaded with towels, washcloths, and bath items.","rack","It holds two towels.","towels","Thick, thirsty bath towels.","tub","What a glorius tub! You REALLY want to take a bath...","towels","Thick towels. Some are emerald green, some are maroon...","washcloths","Cloths the perfect size for washing yourself with.","items","Just bath stuff",}),({"bed","A huge, comfortable bed.","covers","Cool percale sheets and a light blanket.","pillow","A soft, down-filled pillow","book","\"The Gunslinger\" by  Stephen King",}),({"tub","This tub is large enough for six people!","water","Steaming hot water scented with bath oil","bubbles","They cover everything in the tub, including you! No need to be bashful here.","me","You're covered with bubbles!",}),0,0,0,0,0,0,})
